# Drop agent packs here.
#
# Each pack lives in its own subdirectory:
#
#   ./agents/
#     <agent-id>/
#       system-prompt.md          (frontmatter: name, description, tags, model)
#       methodology/index.json    (schema: src/worker/lib/load-agent-pack.ts)
#       methodology/<slug>.md     (any number of guides referenced from index)
#
# After dropping a pack, register it in src/worker/lib/load-agent-pack.ts
# (PACK_REGISTRY) and re-build. The platform deliberately does NOT
# auto-discover packs at runtime — Cloudflare Workers don't have a
# filesystem, and explicit registration makes the deployable bundle
# auditable.
